  "title": "Fasolatha",
  "description": "This is a tomato-based bean soup made piquant with oregano, thyme, and fresh parsley. Buy a fabulous olive oil so that you can enjoy its fruity taste in a very classical Greek soup.",
  "authors": [
    "CORWYNN DARKHOLME"
